     "end": 91.415
    },
    {
     "text": "He doesn't smile at all.",
     "start": 92.311,
     "end": 93.166
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 18,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "\"And this,\" Claire says, \"is Noah.\"",
     "start": 94.387,
     "end": 96.806
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "shot": 19,
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "She lifts a baby out of a bouncer by the couch.",
